They're kissing Choco-sen. Oh, I see, I'm so glad! I'm seriously relieved right now.

204
00:29:14,040 --> 00:29:19,040
なにを言い出そうかと思って、めちゃめちゃ焦ったじゃん今！
I was wondering what you were going to say, I was freaking out so much just now!

205
00:29:19,040 --> 00:29:25,040
ちょこ先輩おめでとうのチューするんだもん。なるほど！なるほど。2人がちょこにチューしてくれるんだ。
You're going to kiss Choco-sen to congratulate her. I see! I see. The two of them will kiss Choco.

206
00:29:25,040 --> 00:29:30,040
