Can't be helped, well, excuse me for a moment... Don't say "can't be helped," you!

208
00:29:36,040 --> 00:29:41,040
なんでお前がしょうがないんだよ！横切ってくれ！
Why are you saying "can't be helped"?! Cross over!

209
00:29:41,040 --> 00:29:47,040
