Well then, here we go! Please... Director, please!

210
00:29:47,040 --> 00:29:54,040
じゃあ、ちょこ先生5周年おめで…ちゅーの、せーのっ！
Well then, Choco-sen, congratulations on your 5th anniversary... Kiss, ready, set!

